            "name": "Marcus T.",
            "flag": "🇺🇸",
            "country": "United States",
            "date": "06/28/2026",
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "MY ENERGY IS BACK — FOR REAL",
            "body": "I'm 41 and had been feeling flat for a couple of years: dragging through the afternoon, no drive in the gym, short fuse at home. Six weeks into Up Men and my mornings feel completely different. I wake up before my alarm, my lifts are climbing again, and my wife noticed the difference before I even said anything. The 90-day guarantee is what got me to try it — I won't be needing it.",
            "photo": "shopify://shop_images/gen_3988_0_1784840338469.png",
            "photo_2": "shopify://shop_images/gen_3995_0_1784840982235.png"
          }
        },
        "review-2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "David R.",
            "flag": "🇺🇸",
            "country": "United States",
            "date": "06/11/2026",
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "Finally something that isn't hype",
            "body": "I've tried at least four different T-boosters over the years and this is the first one where I can actually feel the difference. Sharper at work, better sleep, and recovery between training days is noticeably faster. The ingredient doses match what the studies use, which is why I picked it in the first place.",
            "photo": "shopify://shop_images/gen_3969_0_1784838830451.png"
          }
        },
        "review-3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "James K.",
            "flag": "🇨🇦",
            "country": "Canada",
            "date": "05/30/2026",
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "Third month, still impressed",
            "body": "Ordered the Launch Kit, now on my third month. The focus improvement showed up first (around week two), then strength and drive followed. No jitters, no crash, nothing weird — just steady improvement. The free gifts were actually useful too, especially the tracker.",
            "photo": "shopify://shop_images/gen_4000_0_1784841310117.png"
          }
        },
        "review-4": {
          "type": "review",
